        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<a class="trophy-link" href="kvm-dirty-ring-oob.html">
            <div class="trophy-meta-row">
              <span class="trophy-target">Linux KVM v6.13.7 / v7.0.6</span>
              <span class="trophy-date">2026-05-16</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="trophy-title">A KVM dirty-ring OOB</h3>
            <p class="trophy-body">
              A <code>u64</code> wraparound in <code>kvm_reset_dirty_gfn()</code> sends the reverse-map index 504 bytes before <code>rmap[]</code>. The access lands in vmalloc guard space and faults.
            </p>
